source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-24
observed: A CJK letter is a word rune of one rune, so it refuses the candidate and kills the opener; Jira renders the line literally and jiro keeps it as text.
-- input.jira --
*中*文*
-- rendered.html --
<p>*中*文*</p>
-- want.md --
\*中\*文\*
-- warnings.json --
[]
